      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIVING LEGEND (2) impressed when posting a speedy 25.36 over 450m at Grafton three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Rates a top chance if runs up to time three back. ESCAPE REALITY (8) could manage only sixth at last run before a break, colliding in the run in a Novice race at Cannington and finishing 13 lengths from the winner (30.66). Better than last start and can bounce back. LAUNCH MODE (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing seventh (20.08) from Box 5 at Capalaba over 366m. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and a minor placing from six starts. Should play a prominent role. SCOTCH ROCKET (4) is a last start winner worth following up.",
